{"3948770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I Shouldn’t Have Drawn That!", "steam_appid": 3948770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You were fine until you drew that last card in this single player roguelike card based dungeon crawler!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn  four cards are revealed on the field and it's up to you to choose three to of them. Choose wisely, because <i><strong>dangerous</strong></i> <i><strong>monsters</strong></i>, <i><strong>powerful</strong></i> <i><strong>weapons</strong></i>, and even <i><strong>healing</strong></i> <i><strong>potions</strong></i> may be hiding in the dungeon rooms. If you stumble into a <i><strong>dangerous room</strong></i>, you may <i><strong>sneak past</strong></i> <i><strong>it</strong></i> and return later, but you <i><strong>cannot escape twice in a row</strong></i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948770/extras/00dfdb1a4d3172af367e8621b97d021f.poster.avif?t=1773783628\" aria-label=\"Gameplay footage\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948770/extras/00dfdb1a4d3172af367e8621b97d021f.webm?t=1773783628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948770/extras/00dfdb1a4d3172af367e8621b97d021f.mp4?t=1773783628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <i><strong>custom dungeon decks</strong></i> and <i><strong>share the same dungeon runs</strong></i> with friends to see who survives longer and earns the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May the ancient <strong><i>tutorial</i></strong> help guide you by <strong><i>revealing the secrets</i></strong> of the <strong><i>dungeon</i></strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948770/extras/84eedbe7d9721efabe362b88ebd48b86.avif?t=1773783628\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You were fine until you drew that last card in this single player roguelike card based dungeon crawler!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn  four cards are revealed on the field and it's up to you to choose three to of them. Choose wisely, because <i><strong>dangerous</strong></i> <i><strong>monsters</strong></i>, <i><strong>powerful</strong></i> <i><strong>weapons</strong></i>, and even <i><strong>healing</strong></i> <i><strong>potions</strong></i> may be hiding in the dungeon rooms. If you stumble into a <i><strong>dangerous room</strong></i>, you may <i><strong>sneak past</strong></i> <i><strong>it</strong></i> and return later, but you <i><strong>cannot escape twice in a row</strong></i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948770/extras/00dfdb1a4d3172af367e8621b97d021f.poster.avif?t=1773783628\" aria-label=\"Gameplay footage\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948770/extras/00dfdb1a4d3172af367e8621b97d021f.webm?t=1773783628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948770/extras/00dfdb1a4d3172af367e8621b97d021f.mp4?t=1773783628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <i><strong>custom dungeon decks</strong></i> and <i><strong>share the same dungeon runs</strong></i> with friends to see who survives longer and earns the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May the ancient <strong><i>tutorial</i></strong> help guide you by <strong><i>revealing the secrets</i></strong> of the <strong><i>dungeon</i></strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948770/extras/84eedbe7d9721efabe362b88ebd48b86.avif?t=1773783628\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Decks are dungeons. Each turn reveals four cards and you must face three: fight monsters, swap weapons, or manage your health in this single player roguelike dungeon crawler. Build custom dungeons and share runs with your friends using the same shuffled decks, so everyone faces the same challenges!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948770/30e68bb9a53bff8812b67dc643e909e3f8233e4a/header.jpg?t=1773783628", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948770/86e83cb723e49e3d8593dfe0288b75da42eb7bbc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773783628", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948770/86e83cb723e49e3d8593dfe0288b75da42eb7bbc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773783628", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD FX-4300 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 / NVIDIA GTX 460 / AMD Radeon HD 5850<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM